{
  "dom_id": "step-e2668",
  "name": "Example: Identifying Non-Polyhedra",
  "problem": "Which of the following is **not** a polyhedron?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230697/assets/ceedc03f96a3c801f31069f5551a8c0e5241dbabfc5c9463240a1eb1698a7105.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is **not** a polyhedron is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230697/assets/aea63ad8ff248347de606d37112355cdecc30ab5ae631b987b87f0b9f9d68f17.png)\n\nNotice that one of its faces is not a polygon (it has curved sides).",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e2668\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying Non-Polyhedra</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e2668\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Which of the following is <strong>not</strong> a polyhedron?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-4efe20841a64bdb15fd00b399be9b633\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4efe20841a64bdb15fd00b399be9b633\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <p>Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is <strong>not</strong> a polyhedron is:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-e7c018cff615575f30d66457c542d427\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e7c018cff615575f30d66457c542d427\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Notice that one of its faces is not a polygon (it has <font style=\"color:red\">curved</font> sides).</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
